# Connecting HTML with CSS and JavaScript

## Project Structure

```
project/
│── index.html
│── style.css
└── script.js
```

## Connect CSS

Add this inside the `<head>` section of `index.html`:

```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
```

## Connect JavaScript

Add this before the closing `</body>` tag:

```html
<script src="script.js"></script>
```

## Complete Example

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>My Website</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Hello World!</h1>
    <button>Click Me</button>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

### Explanation
- `href="style.css"` connects the CSS file to style the webpage.
- `src="script.js"` connects the JavaScript file to add functionality.
- Keep all three files (`index.html`, `style.css`, and `script.js`) in the same folder unless you specify a different path.
